#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:91
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of SVT-AV1"
msgstr "Instalação do SVT-AV1"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:94
#, xml-text
msgid "Install SVT-AV1 by running the following commands:"
msgstr "Instale SVT-AV1 executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:97
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr   \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release    \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH=ON \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON        \\\n"
"      -W no-author -G Ninja .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr   \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release    \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH=ON \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON        \\\n"
"      -W no-author -G Ninja .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The test suite is very long and doesn't provide meaningful results. If you "
"want to test the results anyway, issue:"
msgstr ""
"A suíte de teste é muito longa e não fornece resultados significativos. Se "
"você quiser testar os resultados mesmo assim, execute:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:113
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cmake .. -D BUILD_TESTING=ON &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja                        &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja TestVectors            &amp;&amp;\n"
"SVT_AV1_TEST_VECTOR_PATH=$PWD/../test/vectors \\\n"
"ctest -V -O testlog.txt --timeout 10800</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cmake .. -D BUILD_TESTING=ON &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja                        &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja TestVectors            &amp;&amp;\n"
"SVT_AV1_TEST_VECTOR_PATH=$PWD/../test/vectors \\\n"
"ctest -V -O testlog.txt --timeout 10800</userinput>"

#. [sic]
#.  test/Readme.md mentions even more
#.       run_paramter_check failures so I guess those tests are just buggy.
#.       I still get the 12 failures in SvtAv1ApiTests with version 4.0.0.
#.       The failing tests are named EncParam<something>
#. Test.run_paramter_check.
#.         - bdubbs 2026-01-26
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"On a relatively slow system, you may need to increase the timeout for the "
"tests (see the SBU value for the tests on top of the page).  In the "
"SvtAv1ApiTests test, 12 <literal>run_paramter_check</literal> subtests are "
"known to fail.  The test harness will download a copy of libaom (even if "
"<xref linkend='libaom'/> is already installed, the test harness is still "
"unable to use the system installation) and some videos as test inputs."
msgstr ""
"Em um sistema relativamente lento, você possivelmente necessite incrementar "
"o tempo limite para os testes (veja-se o valor de UPC para os testes no topo"
" da página). No teste SvtAv1ApiTests, 12 sub testes "
"<literal>run_paramter_check</literal> são conhecidos por falharem. O "
"conjunto de testes baixará uma cópia da libaom (mesmo se <xref "
"linkend='libaom'/> já estiver instalado, o conjunto de testes ainda será "
"inapto para usar a instalação do sistema) e alguns vídeos como entradas de "
"teste."

